PR^2 & = PS^2 + SR^2 \\
& = (SA^2 + AP^2) + (SD^2 + DR^2) \\
& = 2x^2 + 2y^2 \\
& = 2(200) \\
& = 400
\end{align*} so $PR = \boxed{20}$ m.

